From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Goyvaerts <jonathan.goyvaerts@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 14:11:07 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: dma: apple,admac: Add apple,t6041-admac

The ADMACs behind the M4 Pro/Max (T6040/T6041) AOP have the T8132
register layout.

Signed-off-by: Jonathan Goyvaerts <jonathan.goyvaerts@gmail.com>
Assisted-by: LLM
(cherry picked from commit 70154e655fa24ca8ef33a27b5c4c1f5102cf7f55)
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/dma/apple,admac.yaml | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/dma/apple,admac.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/dma/apple,admac.yaml
index 167ef5a6e5..26a953ed9e 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/dma/apple,admac.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/dma/apple,admac.yaml
@@ -41,6 +41,9 @@ properties:
       - const: apple,t8122-admac
       - const: apple,t8140-admac
       - const: apple,t8132-admac
+      - items:
+          - const: apple,t6041-admac
+          - const: apple,t8132-admac
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
